# This repository intentionally publishes only executable analysis scripts and
# PNG figures located below result-like directories.

# Ignore every file by default while still allowing Git to traverse folders.
*
!*/

# Repository policy.
!.gitignore

# Analysis and workflow scripts.
!*.py
!*.R
!*.r
!*.sh
!*.bash
!*.zsh
!*.pl
!*.jl
!*.ipynb
!*.Rmd
!*.qmd

# Figures only when they live beneath result*, Result*, results*, etc.
!**/[Rr]esult*/**/*.png
!**/[Rr]esult*/**/*.PNG
